noble-hashes 1.8.0 (MIT), the ES modules keccak_256 needs (sha3.js) and the ones
noble-curves' secp256k1 needs beside it (sha2.js, hmac.js, _md.js), copied
unchanged except that utils.js imports ./crypto.js instead of the bare specifier
@noble/hashes/crypto, and the source-map comments are dropped.
